hadiths[28]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1866","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Auf al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur wo Banu Amir bin Luayy ke haleef they aur Badr mein hazir hue they, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Ubaida bin al-Jarrah ko Bahrain ki taraf bheja ke us ka jizya layein, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Bahrain walon se sulah ki thi aur un par Ala bin al-Hadrami ko ameer banaya tha, phir Abu Ubaida Bahrain se maal lekar aaye, phir Ansar ne Abu Ubaida ke aane ki khabar suni to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Subah ki namaz mein hazir hue, phir jab Aap ne unhe Fajr parhayi to wapas tashreef laye aur wo Aap ke samne aaye, phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) muskuraye jab unhe dekha aur farmaya: Mera gumaan hai tum ne sun liya hai ke Abu Ubaida kuch lekar aaye hain, unhon ne kaha: Haan Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Phir khushkhabri lo aur umeed rakho jo tumhe khush kare, phir Allah ki qasam main tum par faqr se nahi darta, lekin tum par darta hun ke tum par duniya phelayi jayegi jaise tum se pehle walon par phelayi gayi, phir tum us mein muqabla karoge jaise unhon ne muqabla kiya, aur wo tumhe halak karegi jaise us ne unhe halak kiya."
"1867","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se ek us ko dekhe jo us par maal aur surat mein fazeelat diya gaya hai to use us ko dekhna chahiye jo us se neeche hai."
"1868","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak Bani Israel mein teen they, bars wala, ganja aur andha, Allah ko unhe aazmana aaya, phir un ki taraf farishta bheja, phir wo bars wale ke paas aaya aur kaha: Kaun si cheez tumhe sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Achha rang aur achhi khaal, logon ne mujhe ganda jana hai, unhon ne kaha: Phir us ne use chhua to us se jata raha aur use achha rang diya gaya, phir kaha: Kaun sa maal tumhe sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Oont, phir use dus mahine ki haamla oontni di gayi aur kaha: Tumhare liye us mein barkat ho, aur wo ganje ke paas aaya aur kaha: Kaun si cheez tumhe sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Achhe baal, aur mujh se ye jata rahe, logon ne mujhe ganda jana hai, unhon ne kaha: Phir us ne use chhua to jata raha aur use achhe baal diye gaye, unhon ne kaha: Phir kaun sa maal tumhe sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Gaay, unhon ne kaha: Phir use haamla gaay di aur kaha: Tumhare liye us mein barkat ho, aur wo andhe ke paas aaya aur kaha: Kaun si cheez tumhe sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Allah meri beenayi wapas kare aur main us se logon ko dekhun, unhon ne kaha: Phir us ne use chhua aur Allah ne us ki beenayi wapas kar di, unhon ne kaha: Phir kaun sa maal tumhe sab se mehboob hai? Us ne kaha: Bakri, phir use bacha dene wali bakri di, phir in dono ke (janwar) paida hue aur is ka (janwar) bacha diya, phir is ke liye oonton ki wadi, aur is ke liye gaayon ki wadi, aur is ke liye bakriyon ki wadi ho gayi, phir wo bars wale ke paas us ki surat aur haalat mein aaya aur kaha: Miskeen shakhs hun, safar mein pahad mujh se kat gaye, phir aaj Allah ke siwa aur phir tumhare siwa pohanch nahi, main tum se mangta hun Us Zaat ke waste jis ne tumhe achha rang, achhi khaal aur maal diya, ek oont jis par safar mein pohanchun, phir us ne us se kaha: Beshak huqooq bahut hain, phir us ne us se kaha: Goya main tumhe pehchanta hun, kya tum bars wale na they jis se log nafrat karte they, faqeer they phir Allah ne tumhe diya? To us ne kaha: Main ne bade se bade ko waris paya hai, phir us ne kaha: Agar tum jhoote ho to Allah tumhe usi ki taraf pher de jo tum they, aur wo ganje ke paas us ki surat aur haalat mein aaya aur us se wahi kaha jo is se kaha tha, phir us ne use wahi jawab diya jo is ne use jawab diya tha, phir us ne kaha: Agar tum jhoote ho to Allah tumhe usi ki taraf pher de jo tum they, aur wo andhe ke paas us ki surat mein aaya aur kaha: Miskeen shakhs hun, musafir hun, safar mein rasiyan mujh se kat gayein, phir aaj Allah ke siwa aur phir tumhare siwa pohanch nahi, main tum se mangta hun Us Zaat ke waste jis ne tumhari beenayi wapas ki, ek bakri jis se safar mein pohanchun, phir us ne kaha: Main andha tha phir Allah ne meri beenayi wapas ki, aur faqeer tha phir Us ne mujhe ghani kiya, phir jo chaaho le lo, phir Allah ki qasam main aaj tumhe kisi cheez mein mashaqqat na dunga jo tum Allah ke liye lo, phir us ne kaha: Apna maal rok lo, tum to bas aazmaye gaye they, phir Allah tum se razi hua aur tumhare dono sathiyon par naraz hua."
"1869","[AI-translation] Hazrat Saad (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak main Arab mein pehla hun jis ne Allah ki rah mein teer phenka, aur hum ne ghazwa kiya jabke hamare paas hubla aur samoore ke patton ke siwa khana na tha, aur hum mein se ek bakri ki tarah leta tha jis mein milawat na hoti, phir Banu Asad mujhe Islam par saza dene lage, tab main na-kam hua aur meri koshish gumrah hui."
"1870","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Aal Muhammad ko guzare laiq rizq de."
"1871","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aal Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina tashreef lane ke baad gehun ke khane se teen raatein lagatar sair na hue yahan tak ke Aap wafat pa gaye."
"1872","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aal Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek din mein do martaba na khaya magar un mein se ek khajoor thi."
"1873","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Urwa se kaha: Ae meri behen ke bete! Beshak hum chand phir chand dekhte they, do mahinon mein teen chand, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke gharon mein aag na jalayi jati thi (Urwa ne kaha) phir main ne kaha: Ae khala! Tumhe kya zinda rakhta tha? Unhon ne kaha: Do kaale: Khajoor aur pani, magar Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke Ansar mein se padosi they, un ke paas doodh wali oontniyan thein, aur wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko un ke doodh mein se dete they aur Aap hamein pilate."
"1874","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) wafat pa gaye jab hum do kaalon khajoor aur pani se sair hue."
"1875","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aal Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khane se teen din sair na hue yahan tak ke Aap wafat pa gaye."
"1876","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: In azab diye gaye logon par dakhil na ho magar rote hue, phir agar rote hue na ho to un par dakhil na ho, tumhe wo na pahunche jo unhe pahuncha."
"1877","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke log Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Samood ki zameen Hijr mein utre, phir unhon ne us ke kunwen se pani bhara aur us se aata gundha, phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe hukm diya ke wo us ke kunwen se jo pani bhara hai use baha dein aur oonton ko aata khilayein, aur unhe hukm diya ke us kunwen se pani bharein jis par oontni aati thi."
"1878","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bewa aur miskeen par koshish karne wala Allah ki rah mein jihad karne wale jaisa hai, ya raat ko qiyam karne wale din ko roza rakhne wale jaisa."
"1879","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Affan (raziyallahu anhu) se Ubaidullah al-Khaulani ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Usman bin Affan ko kehte suna jab logon ne un ke bare mein kaha jab unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki masjid banayi: Beshak tum ne bahut kaha, aur beshak main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jo masjid banaye Allah ka chehra chahte hue, Allah us ke liye us jaisi Jannat mein banayega."
"1880","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jundab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shor karega Allah us ke sath shor karega, aur jo dikhawa karega Allah us ke sath dikhawa karega."
"1881","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak banda kalima kehta hai jismein wo wazeh nahi karta, us se Aag mein girta hai mashriq ke darmiyan se zyada door."
"1882","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, un se kaha gaya: Kaash tum falan ke paas aate aur us se kalam karte, unhon ne kaha: Beshak tum samajhte ho ke main us se kalam nahi karta magar tumhe sunata hun, beshak main us se chhup kar kalam karta hun, baghair is ke ke main aisa darwaza kholun jis ka kholne wala pehla na banun, aur main kisi shakhs se na kahunga jo mujh par ameer tha ke wo logon mein sab se behtar hai, us ke baad jo main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, unhon ne kaha: Aur tum ne use kya kehte suna? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko farmate suna: Qayamat ke din shakhs laya jayega aur Aag mein phenka jayega, phir us ki aantein Aag mein nikal padengi aur wo ghoomega jaise gadha apni chakki se ghoomta hai, phir Aag wale us par jama honge aur kahenge: Ae falan! Tera kya haal hai? Kya tum hamein bhalayi ka hukm na dete they aur burai se na rokte they? Wo kahega: Main tumhe bhalayi ka hukm deta tha aur use na karta tha, aur tumhe burai se rokta tha aur use karta tha."
"1883","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Meri tamam ummat afiyat wali hai magar khullam khulla karne wale, aur beshak behayai mein se hai ke shakhs raat ko amal kare, phir subah kare jabke Allah ne use chhupaya tha, phir kahe: Ae falan! Main ne guzri raat ye ye kiya, jabke wo raat guzara tha us ka Rab use chhupata tha, aur wo subah karta hai Allah ke parde ko us se kholta hai."
"1884","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas do mardon ne chheenk mari, phir Aap ne un mein se ek ko dua di aur doosre ko dua na di, phir Aap se kaha gaya, phir Aap ne farmaya: Is ne Allah ki hamd ki aur is ne Allah ki hamd na ki."
"1885","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jambhayi shaitan se hai, phir jab tum mein se ek jambhayi le to use rokna chahiye jitna ho sake."
"1886","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bani Israel mein se ek ummat gum ho gayi, nahi maloom us ne kya kiya, aur beshak main use chuhe ke siwa nahi samajhta, jab us ke liye oontniyon ke doodh rakhe jayein to na piye, aur jab us ke liye bakriyon ke doodh rakhe jayein to piye, phir main ne Kaab ko ye bayan kiya to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye kehte suna? Main ne kaha: Haan, unhon ne mujh se bar bar kaha, phir main ne kaha: Kya main Taurat parhun?"
"1887","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Momin ek surakh se do martaba nahi dasa jata."
"1888","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakra (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas ek shakhs ki tareef ki, phir Aap ne farmaya: Tujh par afsos, tune apne sathi ki gardan kaat di, tune apne sathi ki gardan kaat di, bar bar, phir farmaya: Tum mein se jo apne bhai ki tareef karne wala ho, na-guzeer, to use kehna chahiye: Main falan ko samajhta hun aur Allah us ka hisab lene wala hai, aur main Allah par kisi ko paak nahi karta, main use ye ye samajhta hun, agar wo us mein se ye janta ho."
"1889","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek shakhs ko suna jo ek shakhs ki tareef karta tha aur us ki madh mein mubalgha karta tha, phir Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne shakhs ki peeth halak kar di (ya kaat di)."
"1890","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne dekha ke main miswak se miswak kar raha hun, phir mere paas do mard aaye un mein se ek doosre se bada tha, phir main ne miswak un mein se chhote ko di, phir mujh se kaha gaya: Bade ko do, phir main ne use un mein se bade ko di."
"1891","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aisi hadith bayan karte they ke agar ginne wala gine to use shumar kar le."
"1892","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) se al-Bara bin Azib ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr mere walid ke paas un ke ghar mein aaye aur un se rehl khareeda, phir Azib se kaha: Apne bete ko bhejo wo use mere sath uthaye, unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne use un ke sath uthaya aur mere walid us ki qeemat lene nikle, phir mere walid ne un se kaha: Ae Abu Bakr! Mujhe bayan karo tum dono ne kya kiya jab tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath raat ko chale, unhon ne kaha: Haan hum ne apni raat aur agle din safar kiya yahan tak ke dopahar khada hua aur rasta khaali ho gaya, us mein koi na guzarta tha, phir hamare liye ek lambi chattan uthayi gayi jis ka saya tha, us par dhoop na aayi thi, phir hum us ke paas utre, aur main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye apne haath se jagah barabar ki taake Aap us par soyein, aur us mein posteen bichhayi aur kaha: Soyiye Ya Rasulullah! Aur main Aap ke gird jo hai use jhaadta hun, phir Aap so gaye aur main nikla aur Aap ke gird jo tha use jhaadne laga, phir achanak main ne ek charwahe ko bakriyon ke sath chattan ki taraf aate dekha, wo us se wahi chahta tha jo hum chahte they, phir main ne kaha: Tum kis ke ho Ae larke? Us ne kaha: Madina (ya Makkah) ke ek mard ka hun, main ne kaha: Kya tumhari bakriyon mein doodh hai? Us ne kaha: Haan, main ne kaha: Kya tum dohte ho? Us ne kaha: Haan, phir us ne bakri pakdi aur main ne kaha: Than ko mitti, baal aur gandagi se jhaado (rawi ne kaha: Phir main ne Bara ko dekha apna ek haath doosre par marte, jhaadte), phir us ne pyale mein thoda doodh doha, aur mere paas chhoti mashkiza thi jo main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye uthayi thi, Aap us se sair hote, peete aur wuzu karte, phir main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur main ne Aap ko jagana napasand kiya, phir main Aap se us waqt mila jab Aap jaage, phir main ne doodh par pani dala yahan tak ke us ka neeche thanda ho gaya, phir main ne kaha: Pijiye Ya Rasulullah! Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne piya yahan tak ke main razi hua, phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya kooch ka waqt nahi aaya? Main ne kaha: Haan, unhon ne kaha: Phir hum suraj dhalne ke baad rawana hue, aur hamara peecha Suraqa bin Malik ne kiya, phir main ne kaha: Hum pakde gaye Ya Rasulullah! Phir Aap ne farmaya: Gham na karo, beshak Allah hamare sath hai, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us par dua ki to us ka ghoda sakht zameen mein pet tak dhans gaya, phir us ne kaha: Beshak main tumhe dekhta hun ke tum dono ne mujh par dua ki hai, phir mere liye dua karo, phir Allah ke liye tum dono par hai ke main tum dono se talash ko rokunga, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke liye dua ki aur wo bach gaya, phir wo kisi se na milta magar kehta: Main ne tumhe yahan se kafi kar diya, phir wo kisi se na milta magar use wapas karta, unhon ne kaha: Aur wo hamare liye wafa kar gaya."
"1893","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bani Israel se kaha gaya: Darwaze mein sajda karte hue dakhil ho aur kaho hitta, phir unhon ne badal diya aur apne koolhon par ghisat-te hue dakhil hue aur kaha: Baal mein dana."
